OL,3,GNEWSACity play areas to be improved
OL,4,Awith grant funding
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree play areas in Lincoln are to be
OL,7,Fimproved following a government funding
OL,8,Fgrant.
OL,10,FCity of Lincoln Council said it had
OL,11,Fbeen awarded #270,000 from the
OL,12,Fgovernment's Playground Fund, which
OL,13,Faims to improve access to playgrounds
OL,14,Fin areas of greatest need.
OL,16,FThe authority said the money will be
OL,17,Fused to improve The Backies in
OL,18,FMoorland, King George V Playing Field
OL,19,Fin Glebe and Sudbrooke Drive Recreation
OL,20,FArea in Minster.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
