OL,3,GNEWSACity play areas to be improved
OL,4,Awith grant funding
OL,5,
OL,6,FRebecca Longbottom from the council
OL,7,Fsaid local communities will be
OL,8,Fconsulted so that the improvements
OL,9,F"reflect what each area actually
OL,10,Fneeds", and the work will take place
OL,11,Fbetween May and December 2027.
